==Description== <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The [[Image:Draft_UpdateShape2DView.svg|24px]] '''Draft UpdateShape2DView''' command forces an update of selected 2D Views or all 2D Views in the document. The {{PropertyData|Auto Update}} property of the views is ignored.

==Usage== <!--T:5-->

<!--T:6-->
# Optionally select one or more 2D Views. For the context menu options a selection of only 2D Views is required.
# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* [[BIM_Workbench|BIM]]: Select the {{MenuCommand|Annotation → Create 2D Views → [[Image:Draft_UpdateShape2DView.svg|16px]] Force 2D View Update}} option from the menu.
#* [[BIM_Workbench|BIM]]: Use the keyboard shortcut: {{KEY|V}} then {{KEY|T}}.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|[[Image:Draft_UpdateShape2DView.svg|16px]] Force 2D View Update}} option from the [[Tree_view|Tree view]] context menu or [[3D_view|3D view]] context menu.
# The selected 2D Views or all 2D Views in the document are updated.


